>What's the average number of protection points to get 
>for 10k zorkmids?  

Depends on your level :)

Assuming you have never previously received protection in the current
game:
Above 25th: 0 (not enough money to gain protection)
13th-25th: 3.5 (only enough money for one donation)
9th-12th: 4.5 (two donations)
7th-8th: 5.5 (three donations)
6th: 6.5 (four donations)
5th: 7.5 (five donations)
4th: 8.5 (six donations)
At 3rd level or lower, you're guaranteed nine points, but the average
returns become tedious to compute, because you've got to analyse all
the paths through the last few donations (1-2 at 3rd, 5-6 at 2nd, 18-19
at 1st).

